  "applicationText": {
    "title": "歌舞伎",
    "blocks": [
      {
        "id": "l21-app-block-001",
        "type": "scene",
        "text": "4点前，小李和小野离开公司，去车站。",
        "translationZh": "4点前，小李和小野离开公司，去车站。",
        "confidence": "high",
        "rawText": "4点前，小李和小野离开公司，去车站。"
      },
      {
        "id": "l21-app-block-002",
        "type": "dialogue",
        "lines": [
          {
            "id": "l21-app-block-002-line-001",
            "speaker": "小野",
            "text": "少し 急ぎましょうか。遅れない ほうが いいですから。",
            "translationZh": "稍微快点儿吧，最好不要迟到。",
            "confidence": "high",
            "rawText": "小野：少し 急ぎましょうか。遅れない ほうが いいですから。",
            "audioSegment": {
              "id": "l21-app-block-002-line-001",
              "trackId": "lesson_apps",
              "sourceUrl": "/data/ocr/audio-clips/lesson21/l21-app-block-002-line-001.mp3",
              "start": 0,
              "end": 3.78,
              "duration": 3.78,
              "method": "approved-asr-alignment",
              "confidence": "approved",
              "reviewedAt": "2026-08-05T08:46:26.551Z",
              "sourceAudioSha256": "f1bacaf343ff40dcae76ac2862d2ca7b3db70a13b6d1a68913ab7f11f0be0119"
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "l21-app-block-002-line-002",
            "speaker": "李",
            "text": "そうしましょう。ところで、小野さんは よく 歌舞伎を 見ますか。",
            "translationZh": "好。话说回来，小野经常看歌舞伎吗？",
            "confidence": "high",
            "rawText": "李：そうしましょう。ところで、小野さんは よく 歌舞伎を 見ますか。",
            "audioSegment": {
              "id": "l21-app-block-002-line-002",
              "trackId": "lesson_apps",
              "sourceUrl": "/data/ocr/audio-clips/lesson21/l21-app-block-002-line-002.mp3",
              "start": 0,
              "end": 4.3,
              "duration": 4.3,
              "method": "approved-asr-alignment",
              "confidence": "approved",
              "reviewedAt": "2026-08-05T08:46:26.551Z",
              "sourceAudioSha256": "f1bacaf343ff40dcae76ac2862d2ca7b3db70a13b6d1a68913ab7f11f0be0119"
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "l21-app-block-002-line-003",
            "speaker": "小野",
            "text": "仕事の 後で、何度か 見に 行った ことが あります。終わりは 9時過ぎですね。食事は どうしますか。",
            "translationZh": "下班后去看过几次。结束大概九点多。饭怎么办？",
            "confidence": "high",
            "rawText": "小野：仕事の 後で、何度か 見に 行った ことが あります。終わりは 9時過ぎですね。食事は どうしますか。",
            "audioSegment": {
              "id": "l21-app-block-002-line-003",
              "trackId": "lesson_apps",
              "sourceUrl": "/data/ocr/audio-clips/lesson21/l21-app-block-002-line-003.mp3",
              "start": 0,
              "end": 11.34,
              "duration": 11.34,
              "method": "approved-asr-alignment",
              "confidence": "approved",
              "reviewedAt": "2026-08-05T08:46:26.551Z",
              "sourceAudioSha256": "f1bacaf343ff40dcae76ac2862d2ca7b3db70a13b6d1a68913ab7f11f0be0119"
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "l21-app-block-002-line-004",
            "speaker": "李",
            "text": "歌舞伎を 見た 後で、食べますか。それとも、見る 前に 何か 食べますか。",
            "translationZh": "看完歌舞伎后吃，还是看之前吃点什么？",
            "confidence": "high",
            "rawText": "李：歌舞伎を 見た 後で、食べますか。それとも、見る 前に 何か 食べますか。",
            "audioSegment": {
              "id": "l21-app-block-002-line-004",
              "trackId": "lesson_apps",
              "sourceUrl": "/data/ocr/audio-clips/lesson21/l21-app-block-002-line-004.mp3",
              "start": 0,
              "end": 5.54,
              "duration": 5.54,
              "method": "approved-asr-alignment",
              "confidence": "approved",
              "reviewedAt": "2026-08-05T08:46:26.551Z",
              "sourceAudioSha256": "f1bacaf343ff40dcae76ac2862d2ca7b3db70a13b6d1a68913ab7f11f0be0119"
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "l21-app-block-002-line-005",
            "speaker": "小野",
            "text": "そうですね…、休憩時間に 食事を しましょうか。",
            "translationZh": "这样啊……休息时间吃饭吧。",
            "confidence": "high",
            "rawText": "小野：そうですね…、休憩時間に 食事を しましょうか。",
            "audioSegment": {
              "id": "l21-app-block-002-line-005",
              "trackId": "lesson_apps",
              "sourceUrl": "/data/ocr/audio-clips/lesson21/l21-app-block-002-line-005.mp3",
              "start": 0,
              "end": 4.11,
              "duration": 4.11,
              "method": "approved-asr-alignment",
              "confidence": "approved",
              "reviewedAt": "2026-08-05T08:46:26.551Z",
              "sourceAudioSha256": "f1bacaf343ff40dcae76ac2862d2ca7b3db70a13b6d1a68913ab7f11f0be0119"
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "l21-app-block-002-line-006",
            "speaker": "李",
            "text": "ええ、いいですよ。",
            "translationZh": "好，可以。",
            "confidence": "high",
            "rawText": "李：ええ、いいですよ。",
            "audioSegment": {
              "id": "l21-app-block-002-line-006",
              "trackId": "lesson_apps",
              "sourceUrl": "/data/ocr/audio-clips/lesson21/l21-app-block-002-line-006.mp3",
              "start": 0,
              "end": 1.42,
              "duration": 1.42,
              "method": "approved-asr-alignment",
              "confidence": "approved",
              "reviewedAt": "2026-08-05T08:46:26.551Z",
              "sourceAudioSha256": "f1bacaf343ff40dcae76ac2862d2ca7b3db70a13b6d1a68913ab7f11f0be0119"
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "l21-app-block-002-line-007",
            "speaker": "小野",
            "text": "じゃあ、早く 行って お弁当を 買った ほうが いいですね。",
            "translationZh": "那快点去买盒饭比较好。",
            "confidence": "high",
            "rawText": "小野：じゃあ、早く 行って お弁当を 買った ほうが いいですね。",
            "audioSegment": {
              "id": "l21-app-block-002-line-007",
              "trackId": "lesson_apps",
              "sourceUrl": "/data/ocr/audio-clips/lesson21/l21-app-block-002-line-007.mp3",
              "start": 0,
              "end": 3.34,
              "duration": 3.34,
              "method": "approved-asr-alignment",
              "confidence": "approved",
              "reviewedAt": "2026-08-05T08:46:26.551Z",
              "sourceAudioSha256": "f1bacaf343ff40dcae76ac2862d2ca7b3db70a13b6d1a68913ab7f11f0be0119"
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "l21-app-block-003",
        "type": "scene",
        "text": "看完歌舞伎后，小李很兴奋。",
        "translationZh": "看完歌舞伎后，小李很兴奋。",
        "confidence": "high",
        "rawText": "看完歌舞伎后，小李很兴奋。"
      },
      {
        "id": "l21-app-block-004",
        "type": "dialogue",
        "lines": [
          {
            "id": "l21-app-block-004-line-001",
            "speaker": "李",
            "text": "言葉は 分かりませんでしたが、とても よかったです。",
            "translationZh": "虽然听不懂语言，但非常好。",
            "confidence": "high",
            "rawText": "李：言葉は 分かりませんでしたが、とても よかったです。",
            "audioSegment": {
              "id": "l21-app-block-004-line-001",
              "trackId": "lesson_apps",
              "sourceUrl": "/data/ocr/audio-clips/lesson21/l21-app-block-004-line-001.mp3",
              "start": 0,
              "end": 3.3,
              "duration": 3.3,
              "method": "approved-asr-alignment",
              "confidence": "approved",
              "reviewedAt": "2026-08-05T08:46:26.551Z",
              "sourceAudioSha256": "f1bacaf343ff40dcae76ac2862d2ca7b3db70a13b6d1a68913ab7f11f0be0119"
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "l21-app-block-004-line-002",
            "speaker": "小野",
            "text": "そうですね。課長に 感謝しましょう。",
            "translationZh": "是啊。感谢科长吧。",
            "confidence": "high",
            "rawText": "小野：そうですね。課長に 感謝しましょう。",
            "audioSegment": {
              "id": "l21-app-block-004-line-002",
              "trackId": "lesson_apps",
              "sourceUrl": "/data/ocr/audio-clips/lesson21/l21-app-block-004-line-002.mp3",
              "start": 0,
              "end": 2.98,
              "duration": 2.98,
              "method": "approved-asr-alignment",
              "confidence": "approved",
              "reviewedAt": "2026-08-05T08:46:26.551Z",
              "sourceAudioSha256": "f1bacaf343ff40dcae76ac2862d2ca7b3db70a13b6d1a68913ab7f11f0be0119"
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "l21-app-block-004-line-003",
